title: Economic Programme
subtitle: Up to three priorities of PPS for the economy.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
card-image: img/polish/polish_party_economic_program.jpg
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && !!Q.polish_party_rules && PolishParty.programmeAvailable(Q) !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card party.economic_program (technical reference 10.5; card catalogue 6.2): the whole set of 0–3
// priorities in one transaction, 1 T, cd 6 M; the present set can be confirmed too (Z — 0.51), since Z — 0.57 on the
// first page. The programme strengthens campaigns among the groups it serves and brings reactions of voters to matching
// and contrary measures (PolishProjects.programmeReaction).
Q.pl_prog_draft = Q.S.actors.pps.strategy.economic_priorities.join(',');
PolishParty.programmeView(Q);
!}

= Economic programme

The present programme: [+ pl_prog_current +]. [? if pl_prog_has = 1 : It makes the campaigns of PPS 10% stronger among [+ pl_prog_served +]. When a matching law or project takes effect while PPS governs or supports the cabinet, these groups lean towards PPS (+1); when PPS votes for a contrary measure, they turn away from it (−1). ?][? if pl_prog_has = 0 : Without a programme, campaigns get no bonus and voters do not judge laws by it. ?]

[? if pl_prog_log : Lately: [+ pl_prog_log +]. ?]

- @confirm_present
- @edit
- @easy_discard

@confirm_present
view-if: pl_prog_has = 1
title: Confirm the present programme: [+ pl_prog_current +]
subtitle: Costs this month's action; the card then waits six months; nothing else changes.
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.programmeStatus(Q, Q.S.actors.pps.strategy.economic_priorities.slice()).available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_prog_present_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.programmeChoose(Q, Q.S.actors.pps.strategy.economic_priorities.slice());
!}
go-to: result

@edit
title: [? if pl_prog_has = 1 : Change the programme ?][? if pl_prog_has = 0 : Compose the programme ?]
subtitle: Choose up to three priorities on the next page. Nothing is spent until you accept them.
go-to: menu

@menu
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.programmeView(Q);
!}

= The new programme

Chosen: [+ pl_prog_draft_text +]. Choose up to three priorities. The priorities prepare nothing by themselves; each programme still needs its card, its law, its money and its executor. Nothing is spent until you accept.

- @toggle_stabilisation_with_protection
- @toggle_public_works
- @toggle_wealth_and_investment
- @toggle_socialisation
- @toggle_agrarian_labour
- @toggle_cooperatives_housing
- @confirm
- @polish_party_economic_program: Start again.

@toggle_stabilisation_with_protection
title: Stabilisation with protections
subtitle: [? if pl_prog_stabilisation_with_protection_now = 1 : **Present programme** ?]We back repairing the currency and the budget, but demand protection of wages and benefits for the unemployed. [? if pl_prog_stabilisation_with_protection_in = 1 : Chosen — remove it from the set. ?][? if pl_prog_stabilisation_with_protection_in = 0 : Add it to the set. ?]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.programmeToggle(Q, 'stabilisation_with_protection');
!}
go-to: menu

@toggle_public_works
title: Public works and employment
subtitle: [? if pl_prog_public_works_now = 1 : **Present programme** ?]The state gives the jobless work on investment and transport. [? if pl_prog_public_works_in = 1 : Chosen — remove it from the set. ?][? if pl_prog_public_works_in = 0 : Add it to the set. ?]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.programmeToggle(Q, 'public_works');
!}
go-to: menu

@toggle_wealth_and_investment
title: Wealth taxes and capital for investment
subtitle: [? if pl_prog_wealth_and_investment_now = 1 : **Present programme** ?]Higher taxes on high incomes and wealth, and public capital for investment. [? if pl_prog_wealth_and_investment_in = 1 : Chosen — remove it from the set. ?][? if pl_prog_wealth_and_investment_in = 0 : Add it to the set. ?]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.programmeToggle(Q, 'wealth_and_investment');
!}
go-to: menu

@toggle_socialisation
title: Socialisation of selected enterprises
subtitle: [? if pl_prog_socialisation_now = 1 : **Present programme** ?]Selected plants come under public control, and their workforces gain a say in running them. [? if pl_prog_socialisation_in = 1 : Chosen — remove it from the set. ?][? if pl_prog_socialisation_in = 0 : Add it to the set. ?]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.programmeToggle(Q, 'socialisation');
!}
go-to: menu

@toggle_agrarian_labour
title: Land reform and rural modernisation
subtitle: [? if pl_prog_agrarian_labour_now = 1 : **Present programme** ?]Parcelling out the large estates, modernising farms and protecting agricultural labourers. [? if pl_prog_agrarian_labour_in = 1 : Chosen — remove it from the set. ?][? if pl_prog_agrarian_labour_in = 0 : Add it to the set. ?]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.programmeToggle(Q, 'agrarian_labour');
!}
go-to: menu

@toggle_cooperatives_housing
title: Cooperatives and housing
subtitle: [? if pl_prog_cooperatives_housing_now = 1 : **Present programme** ?]Consumer and smallholder cooperatives, credit through cooperatives and cooperative housing for workers. [? if pl_prog_cooperatives_housing_in = 1 : Chosen — remove it from the set. ?][? if pl_prog_cooperatives_housing_in = 0 : Add it to the set. ?]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.programmeToggle(Q, 'cooperatives_housing');
!}
go-to: menu

@confirm
title: Accept the new programme
subtitle: Costs this month's action; the card then waits six months.
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.programmeChangeStatus(Q, String(Q.pl_prog_draft || '').split(',').filter(Boolean)).available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_prog_confirm_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.programmeChoose(Q, String(Q.pl_prog_draft || '').split(',').filter(Boolean));
!}
go-to: result

@result
new-page: true

= Economic programme

[+ pl_party_result +]

- @root: Continue.
